<p><%= @first_name.present? ? "Dear #{@first_name}," : "Hello," %></p>

<p>
  We’re opening Mezzanine mid-September — a new coworking space in Matosinhos,
  built for focused workdays and small teams.
</p>

<p>
  <%= image_tag attachments["flyer.jpeg"].url,
